<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-4906] .NET: Examples tests hang</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-4906</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;ExamplesTest&lt;/tt&gt; hangs on various stages: &lt;a href=&quot;http://195.239.208.174/viewType.html?buildTypeId=IgniteTests_IgnitePlatformNetLongRunnin&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;http://195.239.208.174/viewType.html?buildTypeId=IgniteTests_IgnitePlatformNetLongRunnin&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Logs show many multicast-related exceptions. We should probably avoid multicast in tests.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13061164">IGNITE-4906</key>
            <summary>.NET: Examples tests hang</summary>
